    "note": "Adapter capability levels C1–C6 and their mapping to receipt levels are v0. No new receipt levels are introduced. The four-level receipt model (accepted-send, requester-visible, operator-visible, terminal ACK) remains frozen per the v0 freeze (2026-05-09)."
  },
